    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Survival Wars</strong> is an open-world survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will lead a tribe of early humans and guide them through millennia, helping them survive, develop, and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in the Stone Age and progress through human development to the Iron Age, spanning over 10,000 years of history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a wise leader:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure the survival of your people:\u00a0Hunt mammoths, woolly rhinos, and other prehistoric creatures, gather resources, craft tools, and build shelters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/d803cb54d6e13fb511e0a8803d6ba218.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/d803cb54d6e13fb511e0a8803d6ba218.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/d803cb54d6e13fb511e0a8803d6ba218.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop technology:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your crafting skills, make discoveries, and explore new territories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand and protect your settlement:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new homes, fortifications, and weapons to help your people grow and thrive, and to prevent enemies from catching you off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/1e84c954bdf8aad89f54f531dda32715.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/1e84c954bdf8aad89f54f531dda32715.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/1e84c954bdf8aad89f54f531dda32715.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt, set traps for animals:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/3cfe4507f93db1d80d60c924459acb3f.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/3cfe4507f93db1d80d60c924459acb3f.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/3cfe4507f93db1d80d60c924459acb3f.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame wild animals:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness nature, master farming techniques, and tame loyal helpers who will provide you with food and resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather resources:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood, stone, ore, animal skins, bones, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/627266082401ed1871dbec93a584cc8e.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/627266082401ed1871dbec93a584cc8e.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/627266082401ed1871dbec93a584cc8e.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft tools:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axes, picks, knives, spears, bows and arrows - everything you need for hunting, building, and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/be848abffeb85bcbaaf1dc25d8b8afad.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/be848abffeb85bcbaaf1dc25d8b8afad.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/be848abffeb85bcbaaf1dc25d8b8afad.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional details:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of environments, from lush forests to arid deserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose from a variety of tribes, each with its own unique strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a deep research system that allows players to unlock new technologies and abilities.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Primal Survival Wars</strong> is an open-world survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will lead a tribe of early humans and guide them through millennia, helping them survive, develop, and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey in the Stone Age and progress through human development to the Iron Age, spanning over 10,000 years of history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become a wise leader:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure the survival of your people:\u00a0Hunt mammoths, woolly rhinos, and other prehistoric creatures, gather resources, craft tools, and build shelters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/d803cb54d6e13fb511e0a8803d6ba218.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/d803cb54d6e13fb511e0a8803d6ba218.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/d803cb54d6e13fb511e0a8803d6ba218.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop technology:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your crafting skills, make discoveries, and explore new territories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand and protect your settlement:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new homes, fortifications, and weapons to help your people grow and thrive, and to prevent enemies from catching you off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/1e84c954bdf8aad89f54f531dda32715.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/1e84c954bdf8aad89f54f531dda32715.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/1e84c954bdf8aad89f54f531dda32715.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt, set traps for animals:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/3cfe4507f93db1d80d60c924459acb3f.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/3cfe4507f93db1d80d60c924459acb3f.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/3cfe4507f93db1d80d60c924459acb3f.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame wild animals:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness nature, master farming techniques, and tame loyal helpers who will provide you with food and resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather resources:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood, stone, ore, animal skins, bones, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/627266082401ed1871dbec93a584cc8e.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/627266082401ed1871dbec93a584cc8e.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/627266082401ed1871dbec93a584cc8e.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft tools:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axes, picks, knives, spears, bows and arrows - everything you need for hunting, building, and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/be848abffeb85bcbaaf1dc25d8b8afad.poster.avif?t=1750960891\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/be848abffeb85bcbaaf1dc25d8b8afad.webm?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/be848abffeb85bcbaaf1dc25d8b8afad.mp4?t=1750960891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional details:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of environments, from lush forests to arid deserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose from a variety of tribes, each with its own unique strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has a deep research system that allows players to unlock new technologies and abilities.</p>",
